scn 1
# Five armed Drakes (Crusades) standing in one cell sent on one patrol: every flyer's patrol is VTOL_Patrol,
# armed or not, and past stage 0 its air-traffic check (419ee0) steps it out of the stack (VTOL_StepOut) and
# picks the patrol up again at stage 1. Through protocol 307's first cut an armed flyer patrolled without a
# mission and the five lapped as one stack.
name air-stack-patrol
ticks 1800
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
group drakes 0 drake 5 cells 20,80 20,80 20,80 20,80 20,80
at 2 patrol drakes 1800 1280
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
